@plane z=0 label="Context"
The spec stays `specs/types/types.spec.md`.

Core deterministic data structures and enums shared across the codebase: configuration, validation, coverage, language detection, lifecycle, and registry entries.

This plane is context. Later planes are lessons, in the order they were learned.
`context.md` stays beside this file.

@plane z=1 label="Key Decisions"
- Shared types remain deterministic and dependency-light.
- Inference provider identity and credential fields were removed in 5.0.
- Language, validation, coverage, lifecycle, registry, GitHub, rule, and companion types remain canonical.

